Neutralize Charm Hyper egress (PATCH_OUT_HYPER, default 1).

Guards every function that builds a request to https://hyper.charm.land:
the device-flow OAuth (internal/oauth/hyper/device.go: InitiateDeviceAuth,
pollOnce, ExchangeToken, IntrospectToken), the provider-catalog fetch
(internal/config/hyper.go doGet), the credits fetch
(internal/agent/hyper/provider.go FetchCredits), and the LLM proxy path +
x-crush-id header (internal/agent/coordinator.go, hyper case; the now-unused
internal/event import is dropped with it). The hyper packages stay compiled —
they are wired into config/UI across many files, so guards at the egress
chokepoints are the minimal safe cut. See
tasks/reference/dependency-network-audit.md D11.

